<h3>Appointment Scheduling</h3>

Built-in calendaring competes with Calendly and Acuity. Each location can have its own booking widget, availability rules, and confirmation sequences. The round-robin assignment feature works well for locations with multiple service providers.

<h3>Website and Funnel Builder</h3>

GHL includes drag-and-drop builders for landing pages, full websites, and multi-step funnels. While not as sophisticated as dedicated tools like Webflow, they're sufficient for location-specific landing pages and campaign microsites.

<h3>Pipeline and CRM</h3>

Standard pipeline management with custom stages, opportunity values, and activity tracking. The mobile app lets location managers update deals on the go—essential for service businesses with field operations.

